  "Software Details": "Yazılım Detayları",
  "Personalize Your Theme Color With the Theme Customizer module of eCommerceGo, you have full control over your stores appearance. Start by selecting a theme color that aligns with your brand identity. Whether you prefer bold and vibrant hues or subtle and calming shades, this feature allows you to choose from a wide range of colors to make your store visually appealing and unique. By customizing your theme color, you create a consistent and recognizable brand experience for your customers, enhancing their engagement and loyalty.": "Tema Renginizi Kişiselleştirin eCommerceGo'nun Tema Özelleştirici modülü ile mağazanızın görünümü üzerinde tam kontrole sahip olursunuz. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Canlı Demoyu Görüntüle",
  "Define Your Border Color": "Kenarlık Renginizi Tanımlayın",
  "Borders play a crucial role in defining the structure and aesthetics of your stores design. The Theme Customizer module enables you to easily customize border colors to match your chosen theme and enhance the visual hierarchy of your content. This feature allows you to make specific elements stand out or blend seamlessly with the overall design, providing a polished and professional look to your store.": "Sınırlar, mağazanızın tasarımının yapısını ve estetiğini tanımlamada çok önemli bir rol oynar. ",
  "Choose Your Theme White Color": "Temanızı Seçin Beyaz Renk",
  "For those who prefer a clean and minimalist aesthetic, the Theme Customizer module offers the option to adjust the white color used throughout your theme. This feature allows you to select the perfect shade of white that complements your store’s design, ensuring that your content is clear, readable, and visually appealing. A well-chosen white theme color can give your store a fresh, modern look that appeals to a wide audience.": "Temiz ve minimalist bir estetiği tercih edenler için Tema Özelleştirici modülü, temanız genelinde kullanılan beyaz rengi ayarlama seçeneği sunar. ",
  "Customize Your Button Color": "Düğme Renginizi Özelleştirin",
  "Buttons are critical for guiding users through your store, and their color plays a significant role in user experience. With the Theme Customizer module, you can easily change the button colors to ensure they stand out and encourage clicks. Choose colors that complement your theme or make bold choices to draw attention to key actions, such as adding items to a cart or completing a purchase. Customizing button colors helps improve navigation and enhances the overall functionality of your store, making it more user-friendly and visually cohesive.": "Düğmeler, kullanıcılara mağazanızda rehberlik etme açısından kritik öneme sahiptir ve renkleri, kullanıcı deneyiminde önemli bir rol oynar. ",
  "Opt for a Theme Black Color": "Siyah Tema Rengini Tercih Edin",
  "If a dark, sleek look is more in line with your brand, the Theme Customizer module also includes customization options for theme black colors. This allows you to create a more dramatic and sophisticated appearance, ideal for brands aiming to convey elegance or modernity. Adjusting the black theme color can make your products pop and add depth to your store’s overall design, giving it a distinct and memorable feel": "Koyu ve şık bir görünüm markanıza daha uygunsa Tema Özelleştirici modülü ayrıca siyah tema renkleri için özelleştirme seçeneklerini de içerir. ",
